        "product_summary": "Ankle-height platform profile: A rounded toe cap and layered contrast sole frame the textured upper for a distinctive casual fashion collection.\n\nSide zipper plus laces: The side zip opens the ankle area, while the laces adjust across the instep. A heel loop completes the back of the shoe.\n\nRubber outsole: The photographed bottom shows a geometric tread pattern; the cream sidewall keeps the platform shape visually clear.\n\nTwo neutral colourways: Camel and Brown, with EU35-40 options for your women's footwear assortment.\n\nWholesale planning: Send quantities by colour and EU size, packing preference and destination for a quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
